This product queries the following third-party services at runtime. It bundles no
code from them; they are listed for transparency about where scan data comes from.

  - OSV (https://osv.dev), operated by Google, for vulnerability advisories.
  - Package registries for version resolution: PyPI, npm, crates.io, NuGet,
    RubyGems, the Go module proxy and Maven Central.

The test suite bundles the following JSON Schemas, used only to validate this
project's own output and not distributed in the wheel:

  - CycloneDX specification schemas (bom-1.6, spdx, jsf-0.82)
    Copyright OWASP Foundation, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    https://github.com/CycloneDX/specification

  - SARIF 2.1.0 schema
    Copyright OASIS Open, from the sarif-spec repository.
    https://github.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec
